<title>BRAZIL: Brazil govt to auction 326,188 bags coffee April 2.</title>
<headline>Brazil govt to auction 326,188 bags coffee April 2.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will auction 326,188 60-kg bags of coffee stocks in its next monthly sale on April 2, said an official from Banco do Brasil which is to hold the electronic sale.</p>
<p>Of the total, 25,915 bags will be on offer exclusively to the domestic soluble coffee industry, he said.</p>
<p>The sale, scheduled to take place at 1400 local/1700 GMT, will be the largest in a series of monthly auctions throughout the crop year (July/June).</p>
<p>((-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
